<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Pseudo Code and Details of Design of Attention Controller</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present the pseudo codes for the implementation of ASAC in Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Appendix A Pseudo Code and Details of Design of Attention Controller ‣ Attention Schema-based Attention Control (ASAC): A Cognitive-Inspired Approach for Attention Management in Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>. The VQVAE function
mentioned in Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Appendix A Pseudo Code and Details of Design of Attention Controller ‣ Attention Schema-based Attention Control (ASAC): A Cognitive-Inspired Approach for Attention Management in Transformers" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> is further described in Algorithm <a href="#alg2" title="Algorithm 2 ‣ Appendix A Pseudo Code and Details of Design of Attention Controller ‣ Attention Schema-based Attention Control (ASAC): A Cognitive-Inspired Approach for Attention Management in Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> ASAC plugged into multi-head attention</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> scaled dot product: <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z=\frac{QK^{T}}{\sqrt{d_{k}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>K</mi><mi>T</mi></msup></mrow><msqrt><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z=\frac{QK^{T}}{\sqrt{d_{k}}}</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math> are Queries and <math id="alg1.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math> are Keys in Multi-Head Attention

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> Reconstructed scaled dot product: <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{Z}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>Z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{Z}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{Z}\leftarrow VQVAE(Z)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>Z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>E</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{Z}\leftarrow VQVAE(Z)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> Reconstructed scaled dot product <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{Z}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>Z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{Z}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
<figure id="alg2" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span> VQVAE as an Attention Controller</figcaption>
<div id="alg2.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg2.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg2.l1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> scaled dot product: <math id="alg2.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Z</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg2.l2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> Reconstructed scaled dot product: <math id="alg2.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{Z}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>Z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{Z}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg2.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{e}\leftarrow\text{Encoder}(Z)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>Encoder</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{e}\leftarrow\text{Encoder}(Z)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg2.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{e}=\text{EncoderLayers}(Z)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>EncoderLayers</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{e}=\text{EncoderLayers}(Z)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
            
            
          // EncoderLayers contain two linear layers separated by ReLU activation

</div>
<div id="alg2.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg2.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{v}\leftarrow\text{VQ\_update}(Z_{e})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>VQ_update</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{v}\leftarrow\text{VQ\_update}(Z_{e})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
            
            
          Compute distances: <math id="alg2.l7.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="d_{ij}=\|Z_{e}[:,i]-Z_{v}^{\text{prev}}[:,j]\|_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>Z</mi><mi>v</mi><mtext>prev</mtext></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><msub><mo lspace="0em">∥</mo><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{ij}=\|Z_{e}[:,i]-Z_{v}^{\text{prev}}[:,j]\|_{2}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
            
            
          Find nearest indices: <math id="alg2.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j_{i}=\arg\min_{j}d_{ij}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>j</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mi>min</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j_{i}=\arg\min_{j}d_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
            
            
          Update codebook: <math id="alg2.l9.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="Z_{v,\text{new}}=\beta Z_{v}^{\text{prev}}+(1-\beta)Z_{e}[:,j_{i}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>new</mtext></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><msubsup><mi>Z</mi><mi>v</mi><mtext>prev</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{v,\text{new}}=\beta Z_{v}^{\text{prev}}+(1-\beta)Z_{e}[:,j_{i}]</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg2.l10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg2.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{v,\text{new}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>new</mtext></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{v,\text{new}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg2.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{d}\leftarrow\text{Decoder}(Z_{v})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>Decoder</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{d}\leftarrow\text{Decoder}(Z_{v})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
            
            
          <math id="alg2.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{d}=\text{DecoderLayers}(Z_{v})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>DecoderLayers</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{d}=\text{DecoderLayers}(Z_{v})</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">13:</span></span>
            
            
          // DecoderLayers contain two linear layers separated by ReLU activation

</div>
<div id="alg2.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg2.l14.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">14:</span></span>
            
            
          <span id="alg2.l14.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> Reconstructed scaled dot product <math id="alg2.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{Z}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>Z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{Z}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Datasets</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we describe all the datasets used in the paper. A summary of the vision datasets is available in <a href="#A2.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ Appendix B Datasets ‣ Attention Schema-based Attention Control (ASAC): A Cognitive-Inspired Approach for Attention Management in Transformers" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table 3</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T3" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A2.T3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 3</span>: </span><span id="A2.T3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Statistics of Dataset</span></figcaption>
<div id="A2.T3.5" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:469.8pt;height:171.5pt;vertical-align:-83.2pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(4.3pt,-1.6pt) scale(1.01877494828336,1.01877494828336) ;">
